# Mike OS: Amber for Raspberry Pi - software added on top of Raspberry Pi OS Lite.
# Same as the PC version minus LibreOffice, the PC installer and PC hardware drivers.

# --- Desktop: Amber Lite (LXQt + Openbox) is the default on the Pi; KDE Plasma stays installed as a fallback ---
lxqt-core
openbox
gvfs
gvfs-daemons
libglib2.0-bin
# light apps used in Amber Lite (fast to open on a Pi)
qterminal
lximage-qt
qpdfview
featherpad
lxqt-archiver
screengrab
speedcrunch
epiphany-browser
gstreamer1.0-plugins-good
gstreamer1.0-libav
dconf-gsettings-backend
kde-plasma-desktop
kwin-x11
xserver-xorg
sddm
plasma-nm
plasma-pa
pipewire-audio
oxygen-icon-theme
oxygen-sounds
plymouth

